fixture hazard_respawn_drops_stale_dash
doc (movement review 4, M2) as rv_hazard_respawn_fires_stale_jump with the dash: the air dash spent over the pit (frame 31), a dash pressed again 3 ticks before the hazard waits in its buffer, and fires as a ground dash from the respawn point the tick after the send-back, toward the edge with the stick held.
room test/spike_chasm
spawn 300 384
frames 120
input
  0..30 R
  31 R dash
  32..57 R
  58 R dash
  59..119 R
end
expect
  at 31 event.dash=1
  mark die 32..90 event.hazard=1
  never die+1..die+10 event.dash=1
end
